      "writtenOn": "2018-10-24T18:32:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "bubbling up an unaddressed comment (you really should go back through those to make sure everything\u0027s resolved): what happens if msid !\u003d port.msd_id+1? shouldn\u0027t it be an error if we\u0027ve gone backwards or skipped message ids?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1948,
        "startChar": 3,
        "endLine": 1951,
        "endChar": 37
      },
      "revId": "dc823428b93762ade47bbbdc01c8bcf7bd5117cc",
